#: ../../source/recipes/kimi_linear.rst:169
msgid "Caveats"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/recipes/kimi_linear.rst:171
msgid ""
"Generation is **not guaranteed bit-exact** between a cached and a fresh "
"run under concurrent load: KDA / GDN linear-attention backends do not "
"support vLLM's batch-invariant mode, so kernel results can vary with "
"batch composition. Validate with a score-level comparison, not a token-"
"level diff."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/recipes/kimi_linear.rst:175
msgid ""
"Cached pages for the KDA and MLA groups are byte-opaque views, so "
"content-aware processing (CacheGen, CacheBlend) does not apply, and cache"
" entries must not be shared across engines with different attention "
"backends or kernel block sizes."
msgstr ""

